From: XG2010G PPE integration
Subject: [PATCH] net: airoha: use physical egress when GDM2 is present

Backport the direct-egress condition from upstream commit
8e0a754b0836d996802713bbebc87bc1cc17925c to the multi-netdev PonWrt
driver. XG2010G has a real PON GDM2. An external Ethernet egress
marked WAN must retain its own GDM/NBQ destination instead of selecting
the GDM2 loopback reserved for boards without a physical GDM2.

This does not allocate WAN selectors or alter board wiring. Existing
NBQ selection and PON GEM/T-CONT metadata remain in the flow builder.

---
--- a/drivers/net/ethernet/airoha/airoha_ppe.c
+++ b/drivers/net/ethernet/airoha/airoha_ppe.c
@@ -468,7 +468,8 @@
 			*egress_dev = dev;
 
 			port = dev->port;
-			if (dsa_port >= 0 || airoha_is_lan_gdm_dev(dev))
+			if (dsa_port >= 0 || airoha_is_lan_gdm_dev(dev) ||
+			    eth->ports[AIROHA_GDM2_IDX - 1])
 				pse_port = port->id == 4 ? FE_PSE_PORT_GDM4
 							 : port->id;
 			else
